Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: the reading pane's hooks
Applies after 0083-japanese-title-logo.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

The bottom screen's reading pane (3ds_port/src/3ds_reading.c) shows the
message the top screen prints in kanji with furigana, from the player's own
data. The game tells it what a text printer starts on and how fast
(AddTextPrinter: a message types out, a menu prints at once), which template
each buffer it prints from was expanded from (StringExpandPlaceholders,
outermost call only; BattleStringExpandPlaceholders;
DynamicPlaceholderTextUtil_ExpandPlaceholders), and when a window's text goes
(window.c: FillWindowPixelBuffer, a FillWindowPixelRect over the whole window,
ClearWindowTilemap, RemoveWindow); text.c also says where a window's printer
is in its text (CtrText_Progress), for the page the pane shows. Nothing the
game does changes.

